{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那之后……", "text_idx": 98, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "等纱凪缓过劲来能动后……", "text_idx": 99, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那里还有滴下来的痕迹！全都要擦干净！\\n　不能留下一丁点痕迹！」", "text_idx": 101, "plain": "「那里还有滴下来的痕迹！全都要擦干净！　不能留下一丁点痕迹！」", "plain_idx": 102, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7476", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们在活动室里做了个够这件事，绝对——\\n　绝对不可以让其他人知道！」", "text_idx": 104, "plain": "「我们在活动室里做了个够这件事，绝对——　绝对不可以让其他人知道！」", "plain_idx": 105, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7477", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道……」", "text_idx": 107, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们简单地擦拭了一下身子，\\n接着开始拼命地打扫活动室。", "text_idx": 108, "plain": "我们简单地擦拭了一下身子，接着开始拼命地打扫活动室。", "plain_idx": 109, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟刚才做得那么激烈，\\n免不了会有各种各样的液体溅到地板上。", "text_idx": 110, "plain": "毕竟刚才做得那么激烈，免不了会有各种各样的液体溅到地板上。", "plain_idx": 111, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且也正如纱凪所言，\\n再怎么说也至少要避免被社团里的其他人察觉我们在这里做过。", "text_idx": 112, "plain": "而且也正如纱凪所言，再怎么说也至少要避免被社团里的其他人察觉我们在这里做过。", "plain_idx": 113, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃、纱凪，纱凪！\\n　你下面的东西又滴到地板上了！」", "text_idx": 114, "plain": "「呃、纱凪，纱凪！　你下面的东西又滴到地板上了！」", "plain_idx": 115, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……没完没了是吧！\\n　都怪新吾！你射了多少进去啊！」", "text_idx": 116, "plain": "「啊……没完没了是吧！　都怪新吾！你射了多少进去啊！」", "plain_idx": 117, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7478", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算你这么问……我只是把“我有的”都……」", "text_idx": 119, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是，到底榨了多少出来啊！\\n　我到底有多喜欢你啊～～～～！」", "text_idx": 120, "plain": "「我也是，到底榨了多少出来啊！　我到底有多喜欢你啊～～～～！」", "plain_idx": 121, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7479", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……无穷无尽的喜欢？」", "text_idx": 123, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……嗯」", "text_idx": 124, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7480", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈」", "text_idx": 126, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿，哎嘿嘿……」", "text_idx": 127, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7481", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「停！现在可不是说这些的时候！\\n　赶紧打扫，先打扫完再说！」", "text_idx": 129, "plain": "「停！现在可不是说这些的时候！　赶紧打扫，先打扫完再说！」", "plain_idx": 130, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7482", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「活动室由我来负责，纱凪你就，呃、\\n　先把自己清理干净吧……」", "text_idx": 132, "plain": "「活动室由我来负责，纱凪你就，呃、　先把自己清理干净吧……」", "plain_idx": 133, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你说的有道理，\\n　总之我们先冷静下来，把衣服穿好吧」", "text_idx": 134, "plain": "「……你说的有道理，　总之我们先冷静下来，把衣服穿好吧」", "plain_idx": 135, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7483", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实，一直这么光着也有点……」", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之我们先擦干净了自己的身体，\\n穿好了校服。", "text_idx": 138, "plain": "总之我们先擦干净了自己的身体，穿好了校服。", "plain_idx": 139, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……纱凪啊……」", "text_idx": 140, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾，刚才我擦身体的时候，\\n　你不会偷看着又硬起来了吧」", "text_idx": 141, "plain": "「……新吾，刚才我擦身体的时候，　你不会偷看着又硬起来了吧」", "plain_idx": 142, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7484", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有，而且我也没看！\\n　我真的一滴都没有了！」", "text_idx": 144, "plain": "「没有，而且我也没看！　我真的一滴都没有了！」", "plain_idx": 145, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说不定你因为太喜欢我，\\n　还能再来一发……」", "text_idx": 146, "plain": "「说不定你因为太喜欢我，　还能再来一发……」", "plain_idx": 147, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7485", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还真有啊？！不是吧？！\\n　你到底有多喜欢我啊！」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": "「还真有啊？！不是吧？！　你到底有多喜欢我啊！」", "plain_idx": 151, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7486", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也不能说没有这个可能，\\n　我对你的爱大概正是“无穷无尽”吧……」", "text_idx": 153, "plain": "「也不能说没有这个可能，　我对你的爱大概正是“无穷无尽”吧……」", "plain_idx": 154, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那……要不再来一次……」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7487", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我这不也一样吗！\\n　我俩还真是天造地设的一对啊！」", "text_idx": 157, "plain": "「我这不也一样吗！　我俩还真是天造地设的一对啊！」", "plain_idx": 158, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7488", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这样下去感觉会一直重复做爱然后打扫这个过程」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一直做到早上……然后被美羽学姐发现……」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7489", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪正处于做到脱力的状态」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾看着那样的我又硬了，然后……」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7490", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……还是加油打扫吧」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……你说得对……」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7491", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾硬起来的样子只能我一个人看……」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": "「新吾硬起来的样子只能我一个人看……」", "plain_idx": 169, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7492", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，重点是这个吗？」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我才不会给美羽学姐看呢！」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7493", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这么想我倒是很高兴啦，但现在先别管这个了！\\n　冷静点，纱凪！」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": "「你这么想我倒是很高兴啦，但现在先别管这个了！　冷静点，纱凪！」", "plain_idx": 175, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「冷静得下来才怪了！我把那儿擦了又擦，\\n　里面还是有很多你的精液！」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": "「冷静得下来才怪了！我把那儿擦了又擦，　里面还是有很多你的精液！」", "plain_idx": 177, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7494", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了好了我知道了！\\n　总之你先冷静下来——」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": "「好了好了我知道了！　总之你先冷静下来——」", "plain_idx": 180, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……虽然花了不少时间，\\n但我们总算打扫完活动室，离开了学校。", "text_idx": 181, "plain": "……虽然花了不少时间，但我们总算打扫完活动室，离开了学校。", "plain_idx": 182, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……打扫这么久，要是因为味道暴露了，那可就没脸见人了」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7495", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「以防万一，我已经通过风了，\\n　我想应该没问题吧……」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": "「以防万一，我已经通过风了，　我想应该没问题吧……」", "plain_idx": 186, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然已经把能做的都做了，应该没事吧」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7496", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果暴露了，嘿嘿嘿，\\n　你也会负起责任来吧」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": "「如果暴露了，嘿嘿嘿，　你也会负起责任来吧」", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7497", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我会努力的」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的，这里可不该这么说吧，\\n　应该是“我们一起承担责任”才对吧」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": "「真是的，这里可不该这么说吧，　应该是“我们一起承担责任”才对吧」", "plain_idx": 194, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7498", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说着，纱凪从旁边顶了顶我。", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后将脸靠在我的手臂处。", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不会暴露啦。\\n　反正活动室里总有各种各样的味道」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "「……不会暴露啦。　反正活动室里总有各种各样的味道」", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7499", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这倒没错」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，难得激情过后想享受一下恩爱的余韵，\\n　结果根本没时间让咱俩慢慢享受啊……」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": "「唉，难得激情过后想享受一下恩爱的余韵，　结果根本没时间让咱俩慢慢享受啊……」", "plain_idx": 203, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7500", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟地点不太合适……\\n　今后尽量还是找能慢慢享受的地方吧」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": "「毕竟地点不太合适……　今后尽量还是找能慢慢享受的地方吧」", "plain_idx": 206, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、嗯……不过，那个，唔，比起那些事……」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7501", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7502", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她脸颊通红，撒娇似地蹭着我的胳膊。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还有那双仰视着我的濡湿眼眸。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……嗯，也是呢。\\n　今天的份就趁现在……哪怕一点点也好……」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "「啊……嗯，也是呢。　今天的份就趁现在……哪怕一点点也好……」", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7503", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我紧紧地抱住了她。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紧接着纱凪闭上了眼睛，抬起了下巴。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我当即明白了她想要什么。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": "我当即明白了她想要什么。", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、啾……嗯……」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7504", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻地吻了吻她的嘴唇。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪可爱地抖了抖。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿……光是这样做，\\n　感觉全身就充满了“喜欢”这种情绪……」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "「嘿嘿……光是这样做，　感觉全身就充满了“喜欢”这种情绪……」", "plain_idx": 225, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7505", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大概还残留着刚才的余韵吧……」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7506", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……都接吻了，\\n　还能正常地站着哎」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "「……都接吻了，　还能正常地站着哎」", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……真的哎！\\n　都不像以前一样直接软下去了」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "「啊……真的哎！　都不像以前一样直接软下去了」", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7507", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么呢……不过也用不着去考虑这些吧」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7508", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃？为什么？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不懂吗？」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7509", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉……」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼哼……那就由本小姐来告诉你吧」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7510", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯♪」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7511", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪忽地扑向我的脸，\\n冷不防地亲了我一口……", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "纱凪忽地扑向我的脸，冷不防地亲了我一口……", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我已经……体验过更加激烈的东西了，\\n　不是吗……♪」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "「因为我已经……体验过更加激烈的东西了，　不是吗……♪」", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7512", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「懂了吗？」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7513", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……噗，哈哈哈，原来是这样啊……嘿！」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀？！真、真是的，\\n　不要突然把我抱起来呀……！」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": "「呀？！真、真是的，　不要突然把我抱起来呀……！」", "plain_idx": 253, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7514", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我可不想被突然亲过来的你这么说」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要这么说的话——噗、噗呵呵、\\n　这样说下去就没完没了……哈哈」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": "「你要这么说的话——噗、噗呵呵、　这样说下去就没完没了……哈哈」", "plain_idx": 257, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7515", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——2月14日，情人节。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "——2月14日，情人节。", "plain_idx": 259, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对我和纱凪来说，又多了一个值得纪念的节日。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": "对我和纱凪来说，又多了一个值得纪念的节日。", "plain_idx": 260, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
